Rename companions to workspaces and remove the personality system

SecureMind is an operational knowledge tool, not a companion app.
Agent becomes Workspace in the schema, API, and UI. Personality
fields become operational context: a short description of what the
workspace covers, injected at the same system-prompt point.

The migration renames tables and columns in place so existing
conversations, facts, documents, and embeddings survive. Trait
sliders, personality radar, generate-profile, and preferredMode
are removed. Creating a workspace is now name, description, and
context.

Authz tests, seed data, README, and AGENTS.md follow the new model.
